      <Comment source="O-28, pujar">A cDNA clone was isolated from Arabidopsis thaliana, The cDNA encoded a voltage-gated inward rectifying K+ channel. Southern hybridization indicated that only one gene copy is present in the Arabidopsis genome. This gene has a highly conserved domain in the C-terminal region |CITS: [8555458]|.</Comment>
